    "section": "1.67",
    "heading": "Difficult Terrain",
    "lineStart": 590,
    "lineEnd": 594
  },
  "section": "1.67",
  "rulesText": "Combatants are often slowed down by Difficult Terrain. Low furniture, rubble, undergrowth, steep stairs, snow, and shallow bogs are examples of Difficult Terrain.\n\nEvery foot of movement in Difficult Terrain costs 1 extra foot, even if multiple things in a space count as Difficult Terrain."
}
